# Handoff Message Templates

Standardized templates for all handoff messages in the SCRUM workflow. Use these templates for consistency and clarity when handing off work between roles.

## Requirements Analysis Complete

```
@SolutionArchitect

Task: [Task-ID]

Requirements analysis for [Feature Name] is complete and ready for architecture design.

Completed:
- Feature specification documented in tasks/features/FEAT-[id]-[name].md
- User stories and acceptance criteria defined
- Domain events identified
- Integration points mapped
- Edge cases documented

Next steps:
- Architecture design needed
- Task breakdown to follow

Links:
- Feature specification: tasks/features/FEAT-[id]-[name].md
- Related documents: docs/[related-doc].md

Priority: [High/Medium/Low]
```

## Feature Specification Complete

```
@SolutionArchitect

Task: [Task-ID]

Feature specification for [Feature Name] is complete and ready for architecture review.

Completed:
- Business requirements documented in tasks/features/FEAT-[id]-[name].md
- User stories and acceptance criteria defined
